<title>FINLAND: SELIN'S KARHUMAKI JOINS ARCTOS AS SENIOR PARTNER.</title>
<headline>SELIN'S KARHUMAKI JOINS ARCTOS AS SENIOR PARTNER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockbroker Teemu Karhumaki on Tuesday joined brokerage Arctos Securties as a senior partner, Arctos said in a statement.</p>
<p>Karhumaki was previously managing director of Pankkiiriliike Erik Selin, which was acquired by Carnegie in June.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
